title: PuScene3
---
<<camera_shoulder_in "Dialogue System" "Pu">>
GRANDPA: Give it a try. See if you still know how
<<camera_reset "Dialogue System">>
<<wait_for_catch>>
<<camera_shoulder_in "Dialogue System" "Pu">>
GRANDPA: That rod's seen better days — no wonder you're pulling up junk.
GRANDPA: Don't throw it out, though. Go have a word with the shop over there. They'll take it off your hands.
<<camera_reset "Dialogue System">>
<<set $PuSceneMeting = true>>
===

title: SHOPKEEPER
---
<<camera_shoulder_in "Dialogue System" "SHOPKEEPER">>
SHOPKEEPER: Well now… you're old man's grandkid, aren't you?
SHOPKEEPER: Oh, I remember. You were about this tall last I saw you.
SHOPKEEPER: Just got back?
PLAYER: Yeah. I've been missing this place, I guess.
SHOPKEEPER: Mm… that's nice.
SHOPKEEPER: My boy moved to the city, you know. Hasn't been back in a long while.
SHOPKEEPER: Anyway — let's see what you've got there.
//AfterSell
SHOPKEEPER: There's a rod out back. Been collecting dust three years now. Nobody's ever wanted it.
SHOPKEEPER: Take it. I'll knock the price down for you.
<<camera_reset "Dialogue System">>
